  "known_local_policies": [
    "Bamboozle retains the captured friendly defender board residence through reveal waits and same-residence transformation/control changes, then delegates current-local-cost+3 evolution to TransformMinionFromPool. Genuine departure never rebinds a same-ID new residence.",
    "Wandering Monster uses the complete bound Standard three-cost minion pool, ordinary attributed pool draw/quantity/entry pipeline and the actual first main delivery as original attack target before entry reactions. Extra quantity copies do not replace the main target.",
    "Full-board/empty-domain and unknown/unbound-domain outcomes remain the shared producer policies; no executable or target-availability cropping, no replacement draw. Summoning does not execute Battlecry; native entry/Dormant/Colossal declarations remain real.",
    "Current native Dormancy gates are preserved: inactive Wandering Monster main entries do not redirect, while evolution to an inactive defender cancels ordinary combat. Historical2020/2023 first-person reports describe dormant retaliation/secret interactions that differ from this local policy. Current CN confirmation is deferred, without removing dormant candidates.",
    "Three-cost pool membership and evolution cost tiers follow the existing fixed binding and shared current-cost/tier policy, not a new official or latest patch claim. Exact quantity target selection and secret ordering remain pending CN calibration."
